# Proof campaign (run-proof-campaign.ps1): gate receipts, per-run summaries and
# the physical proof sources they bind to are host-local evidence. Unignored,
# they dirty the tree after the first run and trip every clean-tree gate that
# follows -- campaign rerun/skip-reuse, Stage A Blok 0, candidate_freeze_check.
# tests/workflow_proof_campaign_outputs_ignored.py derives this list from the
# scripts, so a new receipt path fails there instead of on the rig.
/validation/proof-gates/
/validation/proof-campaign/
/validation/workflow-proof-latest.json
/validation/workflow-proof-latest.json.tmp
